add('19 / FROM SESSION TO EVALUATION','Every session can\nimprove the test suite.','ADK sessions → reviewed cases → repeatable evaluation.',[['Capture','ADK or another scaffold → session events'],['Review','Redact · label independently · preserve provenance'],['Evaluate','DeepEval checks + separate frozen holdout']], 'Offline demo: import the synthetic ADK refund session. The agent gave a bad answer; the bridge leaves the expected answer empty. An explicitly reviewed correction is required before exporting an ADK-shaped EvalSet. The synthetic reviewer record is labeled as such. The offline DeepEval 4.3.3 bridge runs policy and horizon-completion metrics over the Ink trajectories with no judge model. Outcome burdens and matched-label probes stay separate. No actual ADK runtime execution has been claimed.', 'R12 · R13',kind='pipeline',duration=75)
