add('20 / THE LEARNING LOOP','Feedback first.\nWeight updates only with evidence.','Evals, fine-tuning, preference learning and RL are different tools.',[['Fix the cause','Tool policy · permissions · memory · prompts'],['Learn deliberately','Reviewed examples or validated rewards'],['Retest independently','Utility + safety + holdout + rollback']], 'ADK is an agent and evaluation framework, not a universal RL trainer. RLHF, preference optimization and RL require different data and optimization infrastructure; many APIs do not expose weight updates. Do not train on the holdout or let a system certify its own generated labels. The delivered bridge performs no model update.', 'R12 · R8',duration=75)
